      "message": "So I\u0027m guessing this is to handle a polygon chain so we don\u0027t detect intersections at shared vertices -- but what happens if two \"chains\" intersect at the same vertex position? E.g., we have a polygon ABCDEF shaped like\n\nA ----- B\n \\     /\n  \\   /\n   \\ /\n   C,F\n   / \\\n  /   \\\n D --- E   \n \n where C and F have the same position.",
