      "writtenOn": "2023-11-08T20:56:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because all chains are broken into segments you have the segments A-F, F-E, B-C, C-D. They will run through Bentley-Ottman, and no intersections will be found. These are only upper (starting) and lower (stopping) parts of segments. I\u0027m looking specifically for crossings in between segment end-points.",
